{"page":"MYD88","gene":"MYD88","accession":"Q99836","protein":"Myeloid differentiation primary response protein MyD88","length":296,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q99836-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000650905.2"],"refseq":["NM_002468.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_002459.3"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q99836-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q99836-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":80.6,"plddt":[[0,14],[50,4],[70,10],[90,2],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,16],[90,2],[70,3],[90,9],[70,1],[90,1],[70,3],[90,7],[70,1],[90,1],[70,13],[90,1],[70,11],[90,1],[70,3],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,3],[70,1],[90,1],[70,8],[50,10],[0,3],[50,6],[70,6],[50,5],[70,4],[90,8],[70,5],[90,6],[70,11],[90,3],[70,25],[90,4],[70,11],[90,3],[70,1],[90,2],[70,6],[50,4],[70,3],[90,3],[70,40],[50,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Domain","start":54,"end":109,"description":"Death"},{"type":"Region","start":110,"end":155,"description":"Intermediate domain"},{"type":"Domain","start":159,"end":293,"description":"TIR"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":244,"end":244,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Homodimer. Also forms heterodimers with TIRAP (PubMed:17322885, PubMed:19506249, PubMed:19948740). Binds to TLR2, TLR5, IRAK1, IRAK2 and IRAK4 via their respective TIR domains. Interacts with IL18R1. Interacts with BMX, IL1RL1, IKBKE and IRF7. Interacts with LRRFIP1 and LRRFIP2; this interaction positively regulates Toll-like receptor (TLR) signaling in response to agonist. Interacts with FLII. LRRFIP1 and LRRFIP2 compete with FLII for MYD88-binding. Interacts with IRF1. Upon IL1B treatment, forms a complex with PELI1, IRAK1, IRAK4 and TRAF6; this complex recruits MAP3K7/TAK1, TAB1 and TAB2 to mediate NF-kappa-B activation. Direct binding of SMAD6 to PELI1 prevents the complex formation and hence negatively regulates IL1R-TLR signaling and eventually NF-kappa-B-mediated gene expression. May interact with PIK3AP1. Interacts (via TIR domain) with DHX9 (via H2A and OB-fold regions); this interaction is direct (PubMed:20696886). Interacts with OTUD4 deubiquitinase; the interaction is direct (PubMed:29395066). Interacts with TLR4 (PubMed:36232715)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) In case of infection, interacts with uropathogenic E.coli protein TcpC; suppressing Toll-like receptor (TLR)-mediated cytokine production"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) In case of infection, interacts with uropathogenic E.faecalis protein TcpF; suppressing Toll-like receptor (TLR)-mediated cytokine production"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) In case of infection, interacts with B.melitensis protein TcpB"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with human metapneumovirus protein M2-2; this interaction prevents MYD88-mediated cytokine secretion"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with human cytomegalovirus protein UL88; this interaction degrades MYD88 and reduces innate immune activation"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q99836-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":251,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000417037.8"],"refseq":["NM_001172568.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001166039.2"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,109],[110,155,142]],"edits":[{"start":110,"end":154,"original":"EEDCQKYILKQQQEEAEKPLQVAAVDSSVPRTAELAGITT","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":45,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":23,"foldedMissing":23,"features":[[1,45,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q99836-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q99836-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":77,"plddt":[[0,16],[50,12],[70,8],[90,2],[70,7],[90,21],[70,3],[90,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,17],[90,5],[70,9],[50,4],[0,3],[50,2],[70,11],[90,1],[70,1],[90,3],[70,1],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,11],[50,2],[0,11],[50,5],[70,2],[50,1],[70,5],[9